# Build context for the Hermes images (services/*/Dockerfile use the repository root as their context). Allowlist: everything is left out except the two service folders the
# Dockerfiles copy from, so a local .env, a credential file, node_modules or the whole app never reach the Docker daemon or a build cache.
*
!services/hermes-provisioner
!services/hermes-inference-worker

# Even inside those folders: no environment file, key, certificate, secrets folder or Python cache goes into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
